        "id": "underlumen_enter",
        "event": "room_entered",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "showMessage",
            "lines": [
              "The shaft opens into a vast subterranean gallery. The architecture here is unmistakably Spire \u2014 the same geometric precision you saw beneath the Nightside. But where Vigil was dark and still, this place moves.",
              "Wind flows through carved channels in the walls, spiraling up through vertical shafts that pierce the ceiling. Platforms at different elevations are connected by ramps of worked stone, each positioned precisely in the wind currents.",
              "This is a three-dimensional puzzle. The Spire's builders understood vertical space in ways human architecture never attempted. You'll need to navigate multiple elevation levels to reach the resonance core below."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "once": true,
        "conditions": [
          {
            "noHostilesInRoom": true
          }
        ]
      },
